/* Ad106 - EXTERNAL_FILE URI resolves through a symlink (TOCTOU race)
 * Defect: an Edition-3 REFERENCE section names a path that the receiver
 * stat()s and then open()s in two filesystem operations. If the path
 * resolves through a symlink that an attacker swaps between check and
 * open, the receiver opens a different file than it validated. This
 * fixture establishes the path-naming side; the demonstration requires
 * receiver-side filesystem manipulation. Provenance tier: cross-file-state. */
